      "guid": "com.vinihns.nuts",
      "name": "No Unfair Trade System (NUTS)",
      "slug": "no-unfair-trade-system-nuts",
      "teaser": "NUTS (No Unfair Trade System) removes access to the Flea Market (customizable), ensuring a fairer, more balanced gameplay experience!",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2608.png",
      "downloads": 3035,
      "favourites_count": 1,
      "description": "<blockquote>\n<h1>Mods on Hiatus / Support Paused</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Status:</strong> No updates planned due to focus on other projects.</li>\n<li><strong>Open Invitation:</strong> The community has full permission to update, modify, and redistribute these mods. Feel free to fork the repository and build your own version.</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Basics</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>NUTS (No Unfair Trade System) disables access to the Flea Market and removes the button, ensuring fairer and more challenging gameplay. Get ready for a more balanced experience!</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Configuration</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Each option is self-explanatory; simply hover your mouse over it for a description.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Install</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download the <code>nuts.zip</code>.</li>\n<li>Drag and drop the <code>.zip</code> file directly into the root folder of your SPT installation.</li>\n<li>Right-click the <code>.zip</code> file and select <strong>“Extract Here”</strong>.</li>\n<li>The folders should merge automatically. If you get a prompt to overwrite files, say yes.</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Known Issues</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>If you find any bugs, please report them</li>\n</ul></div></div></div>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/Q5Q116JYQN\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"ko-fi\" /></a></p>\n",
